<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.approval.gathers ~ the approve group, and the verb each line names

`lares nexus approve` gathers the three verbs that carry a promotion's seat approval of exact bytes between vaults as a file: `open` signs the file's hash with the seats held here, `sign` adds another vault's seats once a person confirms the statement digest, `check` reads the verdict over the bytes. Bare, the group names no verb and refuses with this account, exit 2; an unknown word, or a verb missing what it needs, refuses the same way.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ names the verbs and refuses; nothing moves`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.approval.checks]] ~ the group names no verb, or one it does not answer; each of open · sign · check holds its own carrier`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/2 ~ the account of the three verbs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

