!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus approve

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus approve]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

